// Signing settings, applied to every target and configuration.
//
// The development team is per-developer and per-machine, so it lives in
// Secrets.xcconfig, which is gitignored. The include below is `#include?`, not
// `#include`: the optional form is silently skipped when the file is absent, so
// a fresh clone still generates and builds for the simulator with no setup.
// Simulator builds are unsigned and need no team at all.
//
// This indirection exists because DEVELOPMENT_TEAM set through Xcode's Signing
// & Capabilities editor is written into SuperFit.xcodeproj, which is generated
// and gitignored — the next `xcodegen generate` erases it.
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
